{"words": [{"text": "وَعَلَّمَ", "translation": "And He taught"}, {"text": "ءَادَمَ", "translation": "Adam"}, {"text": "ٱلْأَسْمَآءَ", "translation": "the names "}, {"text": "كُلَّهَا", "translation": "all of them"}, {"text": "ثُمَّ", "translation": "Then"}, {"text": "عَرَضَهُمْ", "translation": "He displayed them"}, {"text": "عَلَى", "translation": "to"}, {"text": "ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةِ", "translation": "the angels"}, {"text": "فَقَالَ", "translation": "then He said"}, {"text": "أَنۢبِـُٔونِى", "translation": "Inform Me"}, {"text": "بِأَسْمَآءِ", "translation": "of (the) names"}, {"text": "هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ", "translation": "(of) these"}, {"text": "إِن", "translation": "if"}, {"text": "كُنتُمْ", "translation": "you are"}, {"text": "صَـٰدِقِينَ", "translation": "truthful"}], "sahih": "And He taught Adam the names - all of them. Then He showed them to the angels and said, \"Inform Me of the names of these, if you are truthful.\""}